      "damage_bonus": "0",
      "description": "<p><strong data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"140\">When reduced to 0 HP</strong>, you may spend <strong data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"176\">6 Collected Soul</strong> to enter <strong data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"204\">【Beyond Death】</strong>.<br data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"208\">While in this state, you act normally on your next turn, gain <strong data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"304\">1 additional turn activation</strong>, but cannot be healed.<br data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"330\">If you bring a non-undead creature to 0 HP during this state, your HP becomes your <strong data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"425\">Crisis</strong> score.<br data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"435\">If you are still at 0 HP after your next turn, you must choose to <strong data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"516\">Surrender</strong> or <strong data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"533\">Sacrifice</strong> as normal.</p>",
